B.a5B=new A.aJ("Probability weights and localization heuristics are built from widely taught seizure-semiology teaching points \u2014 features such as lateral tongue bite, forced eye closure, Todd's paralysis, post-ictal prolactin behavior, and lobe-specific aura/semiology patterns commonly referenced in neurology and emergency-medicine teaching (e.g. ILAE seizure classification and semiology glossary, and standard epilepsy/EEG textbooks). This is a transparent heuristic scoring model, not a validated, published clinical prediction rule \u2014 every weight and its rationale is visible in the source and on the result screen.",null,B.jp,null,null,null,null,null,null,null)
